Unified State Vector

GMSS maintains a single global state:

[ \Psi = {u, p, S_i, C_i, \sigma, \tau, T, P, S} ]

Where:

u — displacement

p — pressure

Sᵢ — phase saturations (water, methane)

Cᵢ — chemical/microbial concentrations

σ — stress tensor

τ — shear stress

T — temperature

P — pore pressure

S — salinity

All modules read and write to this unified state.

